!Name: p45backrake-1
!C Period 45 c/3 backwards rake.
!C This uses a period 45 base puffer whose output is perturbed by one large
!C period 3 edge spark spaceship and five small period 3 spaceships into a
!C backwards glider.  This is an improvement on previous versions of this
!C rake.
!C David I. Bell, November 2002
!Source: jslife-moving
!
